<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar management committee to fix refunds.</title>
<headline>EU sugar management committee to fix refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will hold a routine, end-of-month meeting on Wednesday, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;There are no items for discussion and the agenda is just the usual end-of-the-month business,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The committee will set non-annex-II and inulin-syrup export refunds in addition to deciding the usual weekly export tenders.</p>
<p>Molasses import duties will be reviewed. Currently both cane and beet molasses duties are suspended at zero.</p>
</text>
